sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant RMQ as RabbitMQ (agent.publicacion.task)
    participant Runner as AgentRunner (Publicación)
    participant Graph as LangGraph (PublicacionState)
    participant Tools as Tool Services (REST)
    participant GW as LLM Gateway (:8003)
    participant Postiz as tool-postiz (:8016)

    RMQ->>Runner: Recibe agent.task.triggered con idea y canales
    Runner->>Graph: invoke(initial_state)

    alt publication_action == "prepare" (Preparación sin envío)
        Graph->>Tools: GET /client, GET /trends, GET /channels
        Tools-->>Graph: Envelopes con perfiles y canales de la marca
        Graph->>GW: POST /v1/generate (Variante por cada plataforma)
        GW-->>Graph: Contenido adaptado (Instagram, LinkedIn, etc.)
        Graph->>Tools: POST tool-rag /publicaciones (Guarda variante con platform)
        Tools-->>Graph: IDs generados
        Note over Graph: schedule_post registra estado 'prepared'
    else publication_action == "deliver" (Entrega aprobada)
        Note over Graph: START salta directo a nodo schedule_post
        alt Canales válidos y configurados en brand_channels
            Graph->>Postiz: POST /create_post {mode, publish_at, integration_ids, contents}
            Postiz-->>Graph: Resultado creación Postiz {status: "created", post_id}
        else Canales no configurados o sin __type
            Note over Graph: Omisión segura: Postiz omitido, copiado preservado
        end
    end

    Graph-->>Runner: Estado final {publication, variants, postiz}
    Runner->>RMQ: Publica agent.task.completed -> agent.results
